{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05620","headline":"代答闺梦还 · 张若虚","name":"代答闺梦还","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"关塞年华早，楼台别望违。\n试衫着煖气，开镜觅春晖。\n燕入窥罗幕，蜂来上画衣。\n情催桃李艳，心寄管弦飞。\n妆洗朝相待，风花暝不归。\n梦魂何处入，寂寂掩重扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张若虚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}